    "detailed_description": "\u300aLOLI RACING\u300bis a Japanese-style kart racing game, the overall operation difficulty is low and easy to get started, only need to control the direction and drift easy arrive to the finish line.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/a3482226b6bf201c6cd92e7db9b9704e.poster.avif?t=1753685757\" width=480 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/a3482226b6bf201c6cd92e7db9b9704e.webm?t=1753685757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/a3482226b6bf201c6cd92e7db9b9704e.mp4?t=1753685757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Players can choose to race alone or invite friends to race together.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/6b220af0c29343b9492276c00db80758.avif?t=1753685757\" width=650 height=370 /></span><br>The racing tracks you can play have many different themes to choose from, such as shrines and historic site in Japan, urban attractions in Taiwan, or future cities full of high technology.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/622fff4313a438f1470a4c491c78e888.avif?t=1753685757\" width=650 height=370 /></span><br>Players can choose their favorite characters and karts, and the performance and appearance of each kart are different.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/72931103862e1c0ca581c3fe3c0a9cf6.poster.avif?t=1753685757\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/72931103862e1c0ca581c3fe3c0a9cf6.webm?t=1753685757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/72931103862e1c0ca581c3fe3c0a9cf6.mp4?t=1753685757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Performance is divided into speed, acceleration, steering, drift, while appearance will vary according to the character's style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/ce54bb960bd7b91ca87c2ce8d83c4a71.avif?t=1753685757\" width=650 height=370 /></span><br>Currently supported game content:<br>\u25b6Single player and multiplayer<br>\u25b6Chat room (lobby only)<br>\u25b638 tracks<br>\u25b615 characters and karts<br>\u25b6Two game modes<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/3de1e182cf8afa7a8d7239b518febaf7.avif?t=1753685757\" width=650 height=370 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "\u300aLOLI RACING\u300bis a Japanese-style kart racing game, the overall operation difficulty is low and easy to get started, only need to control the direction and drift easy arrive to the finish line.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/a3482226b6bf201c6cd92e7db9b9704e.poster.avif?t=1753685757\" width=480 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/a3482226b6bf201c6cd92e7db9b9704e.webm?t=1753685757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/a3482226b6bf201c6cd92e7db9b9704e.mp4?t=1753685757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Players can choose to race alone or invite friends to race together.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/6b220af0c29343b9492276c00db80758.avif?t=1753685757\" width=650 height=370 /></span><br>The racing tracks you can play have many different themes to choose from, such as shrines and historic site in Japan, urban attractions in Taiwan, or future cities full of high technology.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/622fff4313a438f1470a4c491c78e888.avif?t=1753685757\" width=650 height=370 /></span><br>Players can choose their favorite characters and karts, and the performance and appearance of each kart are different.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/72931103862e1c0ca581c3fe3c0a9cf6.poster.avif?t=1753685757\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/72931103862e1c0ca581c3fe3c0a9cf6.webm?t=1753685757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/72931103862e1c0ca581c3fe3c0a9cf6.mp4?t=1753685757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Performance is divided into speed, acceleration, steering, drift, while appearance will vary according to the character's style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/ce54bb960bd7b91ca87c2ce8d83c4a71.avif?t=1753685757\" width=650 height=370 /></span><br>Currently supported game content:<br>\u25b6Single player and multiplayer<br>\u25b6Chat room (lobby only)<br>\u25b638 tracks<br>\u25b615 characters and karts<br>\u25b6Two game modes<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786360/extras/3de1e182cf8afa7a8d7239b518febaf7.avif?t=1753685757\" width=650 height=370 /></span>",
    "short_description": "\u300aLOLI RACING\u300bis a Japanese-style kart racing game, the overall operation difficulty is low and easy to get started, there are 15 types of karts and characters can choose from, in terms of maps, there are 38 tracks with different themes to play, support single-player and multiplayer",
